{"id":"act17d0_level_act17d0_06_beg","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_nobleN"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop","volume":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"How long has it been, dear sister?"},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Six months? A year? Longer?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"Drudge, you attacked the Lord's men and stormed his manor. This is treason!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Treason? Hah. Heh heh."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"You have to know, Picale."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"If it weren't for that rotting old man's obsession with protecting his infected... oh, distressed assets."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"This wouldn't even be your place."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Relax, girl."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Check out these toys from an enthusiastic Columbian donor."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.6,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"subtitle","a":{"text":"The cunning Reproba slaps the device behind him.","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"center","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"subtitle","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"The TSW-2 Ultrasonic Impact Unit, a product of advanced technology. It's experimental, never used in the field before. The only downside is the size."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"It was real tough to hide in town. Took a while."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Took me a while to get you out of the mansion too."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"So tell me, my dearest little sister, what good are your sick moves now? What good is that iron will of yours?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"And check out my friends here. Sarkaz friends."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"They're not your run-of-the-mill braindead devils. They're from Columbia too. They get the job done."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"You know what that means?"},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"It means they're here for progress. Progress you and the old man could never understand."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Get your margins high enough and money's more powerful than you can possibly imagine."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Whatever happened to the old man's worthless logic?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_007"}},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"Boss, we found this in a big house."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Give it to me."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Oh, an appointment letter from the Lord Ameer of Bayalir."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Fine grain papyrus, embossed signature, blocky Bayalir writing, and this black seal."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Hmph."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Where's the old man?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_007"}},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"He wasn't there. We searched every room and found plenty of townsfolk, but not the old man you're talking about."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"Father is dead. I am the Lord of Long Spring now."},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"You have disobeyed your Lord, and in so doing disobeyed the Lord Ameer, and for that your punishment is death!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"That's the plan you and the old man came up with?"},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Hahaha..."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Hahahahaha..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.03,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_fightgeneral","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.03,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"Grrgh!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"This is getting stupid. You really think you can use the Lord Ameer to outmaneuver me? Don't make me laugh."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"You're gonna execute me?"},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"The old man's proud Reproba guards are lying headless in an alley somewhere right now."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Those tough guards are gone now, and who's left to stop me?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"You're a psychotic piece of shit! You grew up with them! They treated you like their own son! I didn't think you were this far gone..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"They shouldn't have gotten in my way."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"And neither should you."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"We're blood, so let me make it a little clearer for you, sis. I wanna be sure you understand."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Yes, you're a Lord of Sargon now. Sure."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"But me? I'm a bum, abandoned by my family."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"And in a few years, when you meet an unfortunate end, I'll go to the Court of Bayalir."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"With my pedigree, plus the resources and wealth to prove my loyalty to the Lord Ameer, do you think he might just hand Long Spring back to me?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"No!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Why don't I give you another scenario: let's say you die in battle just a short while after taking charge."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Then I hand your corpse over to the Lord Ameer, and get to join the Zhayedan, would that work out better for me?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"Drudge, you're a disgusting, horrific, disaster of a person!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"You're getting excited, sis."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_empty"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_rungeneral","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"move","xpos":-200,"fadetime":0.3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.51}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"move","xpos":200,"fadetime":1,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_166","blackstart":0.14,"blackend":0.4,"fadetime":0.7,"focus":-1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_rungeneral","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"move","xpos":300,"fadetime":2,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"All that's just hypothetical. It's not real. We're having a brother-sister talk here."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Because I know a much better place for you."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"See these things with the rocks on them?"},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"If you're so eager to protect the Infected, why not join 'em?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"Drudge!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Once you die from it, I'll find a nice cave to bury you in."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Then you and the old man can watch me dig out the Originium buried under the mines and turn Long Spring into the mineral heart of Bayalir."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"So, what do you think?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"...You sold out your family, and sold out our land! I curse you, Drudge. May you die a horrible death!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Whatever makes you happy, sis. Curse away. Use that voice while you've still got it."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"I guess we're done here."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_empty","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"(Columbian) You, come here."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_empty","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_rungeneral","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"left","type":"move","xpos":-200,"fadetime":0.3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.51}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"left","type":"move","xpos":200,"fadetime":1,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","fadetime":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"(Columbian) What is it, Boss?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"(Columbian) Bring the Infected to the egghead."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_160_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Miarow","text":"*cough* *cough*..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"(Columbian) Right. I'm on it."},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"(Columbian) What about this kid? Looks like he's on his way out."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"(Columbian) Bring him, dead or alive."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"(Columbian) As for my sister..."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"(Columbian) Turn her Infected. You Sarkaz must know how to do it."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"(Columbian) Roger."},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"(Columbian) But that isn't in our contract. There'll be an extra fee."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"(Columbian) Save it. You know there'll be plenty of money to go around once our work here is done and the mine is up and running."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2","name2":"avg_npc_053","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"What a nice brother you have there."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2","name2":"avg_npc_053","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"(Closes eyes)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2","name2":"avg_npc_053","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"(Raises weapon)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_arrow_h","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053"}},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"Erm..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_bodyfalldown3"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_007"}},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"We're under attack! Get a shield up, protect the boss!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act13d5d0/m_bat_warchaos_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act13d5d0/m_bat_warchaos_loop","volume":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"image":"avg_ac17_7_1","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_arrow_h","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"Wha?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_bodyfalldown3"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"What's happening?!"},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"Boss, we've got company!"},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"I thought you took care of all the guardsmen!"},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"I saw! I saw! It's..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"image":"avg_ac17_7","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_arrow_h","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"Aagh!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_bodyfalldown3"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Caster, get the monsters moving!"},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary Caster","text":"Wait... I see... It's..."},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"Hurry!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_arrow_h","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"Ahhhh! My shoulder! My shoulder!"},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"Don't panic! Where's the enemy?"},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"I... I don't see them!"},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"Fall back. They've got crossbows. Get to cover!"},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"Cover Drudge! We can't let anything happen to him!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_166","fadetime":0.7,"focus":-1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_007"}},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"I saw! It's a Feline!"},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary","text":"Look out! Retreat! Retreat!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_166"}},{"t":"line","name":"Schwarz","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"You... You're with Rhodes Island..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_166"}},{"t":"line","name":"Schwarz","text":"Can you move, Reproba?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"Thanks..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.7}},{"t":"line","name":"Originiutant","text":"Gaa..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary Caster","text":"Okay, it's working."},{"t":"line","name":"Mercenary Caster","text":"This isn't over yet. Hahaha."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_158_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Hmph, the old man's toys can only be useful at a time like this."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"You, take the monsters and finish them off."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053"}},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"Roger."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#1","name2":"avg_npc_166","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Schwarz","text":"There's too many. I can't guarantee your safe escape."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2","name2":"avg_npc_166","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"This will do."},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"Where are my weapons?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2","name2":"avg_npc_166","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Schwarz","text":"What for?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2","name2":"avg_npc_166","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"It's my fault Drudge turned out like this."},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"I can't face my late father..."},{"t":"line","name":"Picale","text":"But I will carve out that traitor's heart and bury it in Long Spring if it's the last thing I do!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_159_1#2","name2":"avg_npc_166","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Schwarz","text":"Don't be hasty, there's too many of them. Getting yourself killed won't help the town survive."},{"t":"line","name":"Schwarz","text":"I've sent out the signal. They should be here in a minute."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"Boss! Those mercenaries and Rhodes Island are assaulting us."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"What are you afraid of? With this mansion tough as iron, I don't believe those mercenaries can cause us any harm."},{"t":"line","name":"Drudge","text":"Tell those casters to finish that Feline with monsters. Others go defend the entrance."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_053","name2":"avg_npc_158_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Sarkaz Mercenary","text":"Roger."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_deserttownN"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_456_ash_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ash","t